# Claude Code local state (settings, worktrees, scratch)
# Local Claude Code config stays out; shared skills are version-controlled.
# So is the session-start hook and the settings that register it: the web container is
# rebuilt from this repo, so the hook only runs if it lives here. Personal overrides
# (.claude/settings.local.json) stay ignored by the rule above.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/settings.json
*.tsbuildinfo
# Local cloud startup script with secrets (never commit)
backend/start-cloud.ps1
